    {
      "id": "bdcf995e",
      "title": "Notify the PM from gate request and card open",
      "description": "da-t7. Criteria: DA-01.1 to DA-01.6; DA-03.4 (README, rule 12; tech-writer writes the paragraph at /devolps:pr step 2). Tests: one 'DA-01.n: ...' test per criterion; 'DA-03.4: README names the commands, the off switch and macOS only'. Verify: npm test -- notify. Adds 1 import and 2 calls in cli/index.ts. Lines: ~101 (cli 4 + README 12 from design 3.4; tests 85 from architect hand-off, not checked). Over 100 because rule 12 puts the README paragraph in this change. Depends on: da-t1 merged, da-t6. Real banners start on this Mac once built here; merge da-t8 right after.\n\nNotes from the PR #16 reviews (EM, 2026-10-09): (1) The CLI only calls notifyDecision; it writes no \"notification not sent\" line of its own (notifyDecision writes it), or stderr gets it twice. (2) Add a CLI-level DA-02.5 check: `gate request` and `card open` with notify on (stubEnv) and with it off give the same event-log lines, because the in-process DA-02.5 test does not cover the call sites (security F4). (3) Every CLI subprocess env in tests comes from stubEnv(...) (with overrides only for off and the platform); never run the CLI with process.env and notify on.",
